Z||000003||StuGood||07-15-2001||12:54 PM||||Well, anytime you go to a dealership and get rid of a car you don't want - for a car you <B>do</B> want - and no money changes hands -you can't do much better than that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Plus, now got two cars with a lot of compatible parts - sounds good to me!  ||||reg||14
