Z||000007||Jefrysuko||07-15-2001||10:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroGTguy:<BR><B>Hey!  You never told me about the rusted floorboards when you wanted to trade your T-Bird for my 86 SE.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>How many miles are on that new car of yours?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Greg</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Yeah I found the rust on the floorboards after I talked to you about trading.  I had a guy interested but he wanted to check the floorboards before he bought it.  I pulled up the carpet to check for him and not only did I find rust but there was also a puddle of water in there.  I would have told you about the additional rust if we had continued talking about the trade.<P>76k is all this one has on it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
